  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winterization Project in Mykolaiv City /Oblast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, DRC aims to procure and deliver the building/repair materials requested by Mykolaiv Municipality in 4 to 6 weeks and part equipment and spare parts to carry out emergency repair of water supply and district heating system within the next 2-3 months. DRC&#x2019;s role in the project will be procuring the required goods, delivering them to Mykolaiv Municipality officials, and &#x2013; according to the security situation in the city/oblast &#x2013; implement 2 or 3 monitoring missions to verify work progress. The action will be implemented by DRC Ukraine with the supervision and support of the DRC regional office for Europe, and DRC HQ.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Mykolaiv region in addressing the urgent needs before winter 2022/2023, including i) emergency repair of windows and doors in residential blocks; ii) emergency repair of heating supply; and iii) emergency repair of water supply.</narrative>
  </description>
